
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SALESREAD.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.

    SELECT SALES-FILE ASSIGN TO EXTERNAL SALESIN
        ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
        ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
        FILE STATUS IS WS-STATUS.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.

FD SALES-FILE.
01 SALES-REC.
   05 SALES-ID       PIC X(4).
   05 FILLER         PIC X(1).
   05 SALES-AMOUNT   PIC X(4).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 WS-STATUS         PIC X(2).
01 WS-EOF            PIC X VALUE 'N'.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

MAIN-PARA.

    OPEN INPUT SALES-FILE

    IF WS-STATUS = '00'
        PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = 'Y'

            READ SALES-FILE

            EVALUATE WS-STATUS

                WHEN '00'
                    DISPLAY SALES-REC

                WHEN '10'
                    MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF

                WHEN OTHER
                    DISPLAY 'FILE ERROR: ' WS-STATUS
                    MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF

            END-EVALUATE

        END-PERFORM

        CLOSE SALES-FILE

    ELSE
        DISPLAY 'OPEN ERROR: ' WS-STATUS
    END-IF.

    STOP RUN.
